{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/qwik-table"},{"type":"text","value":" adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of it's job is related to managing state the \"qwik\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"exports","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exports"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/qwik-table"},{"type":"text","value":" re-exports all of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/table-core"},{"type":"text","value":"'s APIs and the following:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"useqwiktable","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQwikTable"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Takes an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object and returns a table from a Qwik Store with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"NoSerialize"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useQwikTable } from '@tanstack/qwik-table'\n\nconst table = useQwikTable(options)\n// ...render your table\n","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"flexrender","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"flexRender"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A utility function for rendering cell/header/footer templates with dynamic values."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { flexRender } from '@tanstack/qwik-table'\n//...\nreturn (\n  <tbody>\n    {table.getRowModel().rows.map(row => {\n      return (\n        <tr key={row.id}>\n          {row.getVisibleCells().map(cell => (\n            <td key={cell.id}>\n              {flexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())}\n            </td>\n          ))}\n        </tr>\n      )\n    })}\n  </tbody>\n);","lang":"jsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"exports","text":"Exports","level":2},{"id":"useqwiktable","text":"useQwikTable","level":3},{"id":"flexrender","text":"flexRender","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `@tanstack/qwik-table` adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of it's job is related to managing state the \"qwik\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates.\n\n## Exports\n\n`@tanstack/qwik-table` re-exports all of `@tanstack/table-core`'s APIs and the following:\n\n### `useQwikTable`\n\nTakes an `options` object and returns a table from a Qwik Store with `NoSerialize`.\n\n```ts\nimport { useQwikTable } from '@tanstack/qwik-table'\n\nconst table = useQwikTable(options)\n// ...render your table\n\n```\n\n### `flexRender`\n\nA utility function for rendering cell/header/footer templates with dynamic values.\n\nExample:\n\n```jsx\nimport { flexRender } from '@tanstack/qwik-table'\n//...\nreturn (\n  <tbody>\n    {table.getRowModel().rows.map(row => {\n      return (\n        <tr key={row.id}>\n          {row.getVisibleCells().map(cell => (\n            <td key={cell.id}>\n              {flexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())}\n            </td>\n          ))}\n        </tr>\n      )\n    })}\n  </tbody>\n);\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Qwik Table\n---\n\nThe `@tanstack/qwik-table` adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of it's job is related to managing state the \"qwik\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates.\n\n## Exports\n\n`@tanstack/qwik-table` re-exports all of `@tanstack/table-core`'s APIs and the following:\n\n### `useQwikTable`\n\nTakes an `options` object and returns a table from a Qwik Store with `NoSerialize`.\n\n```ts\nimport { useQwikTable } from '@tanstack/qwik-table'\n\nconst table = useQwikTable(options)\n// ...render your table\n\n```\n\n### `flexRender`\n\nA utility function for rendering cell/header/footer templates with dynamic values.\n\nExample:\n\n```jsx\nimport { flexRender } from '@tanstack/qwik-table'\n//...\nreturn (\n  <tbody>\n    {table.getRowModel().rows.map(row => {\n      return (\n        <tr key={row.id}>\n          {row.getVisibleCells().map(cell => (\n            <td key={cell.id}>\n              {flexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())}\n            </td>\n          ))}\n        </tr>\n      )\n    })}\n  </tbody>\n);\n```\n"}
